# Evidence logs inside recorded review artifacts are part of the durable record
# (retained RED/GREEN runs, exporter rebuilds, protection-canary output), not
# development noise. The repository-root `*.log` rule would otherwise drop them
# silently while the handoffs cite them. This negation is scoped to artifacts/.
!*.log

# Raw benchmark reports carry per-frame sample arrays (~400 KB each, 9 MB for the
# S09 sweep). The compact form plus their sha256 is what the receipt cites, so the
# raw files stay out of Git and out of a later bulk add.
s09/performance/*-t[123].json
